title: spawnkit
abstract: >-
  Process hygiene, worker supervision and batched GPU inference for spawn-mode
  multiprocessing: keeping CPU-only workers off the GPU, making one seed reproduce
  a run across spawn, turning a silent worker death into a fast and explained
  shutdown, and serving batched inference from a single GPU process.
